      "unit": "share of paid employees (pay period incl. March 12) in establishments of multiunit firms",
      "year": 2022,
      "source": {
        "publisher": "U.S. Census Bureau",
        "table": "2022 Economic Census, Establishment and Firm Size: Single Unit and Multiunit Firms for the U.S. (EC2200SIZESUMU), INDLEVEL 2, TYPOP 00, SUMUFI 001/200/300",
        "url": "https://www2.census.gov/programs-surveys/economic-census/data/2022/sector00/EC2200SIZESUMU.zip",
        "tableUrl": "https://data.census.gov/table/ECNSIZE2022.EC2200SIZESUMU",
        "released": "2025-04-10 (file date)"
      },
      "notes": "Derived: sum over the 17 Economic Census sectors of SUMUFI 300 EMP (81559757) / SUMUFI 001 EMP (132116204). Single-unit firms 0.3827. Economic Census scope excludes NAICS 11 (most of agriculture), 55 (management of companies; headquarters, all multiunit), 92 public administration, and some government-owned units (e.g., public schools), so the true all-private share is likely slightly higher. No all-sectors total row exists in the table; sector sums are additive for establishments and employment."
    },
